  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (Section 4, chapter 1, Oregon Laws 2023): (B) Holds a valid concealed handgun license issued under ORS 166.291 and 166.292.\nSECTION 1 (Section 4, chapter 1, Oregon Laws 2023): The department shall charge a reduced fee for persons who do not require fingerprinting or a criminal background check due to holding a valid concealed handgun license.\nSECTION 1 (Section 4, chapter 1, Oregon Laws 2023): (c) A criminal background check is not required for a person who: (A) Was qualified at the time the original permit was issued due to holding a valid concealed handgun license; and (B) Continues to hold a valid concealed handgun license."
